-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1107: a WITHIN that reads the rule's own input is not
-- worked out, so its deadline stays unknown and its tick untried.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF pay

GIVEN period IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`given` period MEANS PARTY Alice MUST pay WITHIN period LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late"

#TRACE `given` 10 AT 0 WITH
